android/captures/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
# Firebase's Android client config is not a secret — Google publishes it as a
# file that ships inside every APK, and the key in it is restricted to this
# package name plus the signing certificate. CI cannot build an FCM-enabled
# build without it, and this repository is private, so the app's copy is
# tracked. Any other copy that turns up stays ignored.
google-services.json
!android/app/google-services.json

